# Astro `class:list` formatting

When using `class:list` with a base class plus conditional class map, put each conditional entry on its own line:

```astro
<div class:list={['stamp', { 
  'stamp-sun': sun, 
  'stamp--no-background': !background, 
  'stamp--rotate': rotate, 
  'stamp--rotational-bounce': rotationalBounce }]}>
```

Do not collapse the conditional object onto one line when it has more than one entry.
